OL,3,GNEWSAUncertain future for ageing
OL,4,ACambridge Guildhall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 1930s building on a city centre site
OL,7,Fthat has been the heart of civic life
OL,8,Ffor 800 years is at risk of falling
OL,9,Fapart, according to a report.
OL,11,FCambridge City Council said the
OL,12,FGuildhall on Market Square could
OL,13,Fsuccumb to "Regent Street Disease" - a
OL,14,Fdefect affecting early 20th Century
OL,15,Fsteel-framed buildings.
OL,17,FCouncillors will debate different
OL,18,Foptions to save the Guildhall at a
OL,19,Fmeeting on Tuesday, including paying
OL,20,Ffor repairs or selling it to become a
OL,21,Fboutique hotel.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
